      <title>小米平板 9 Pro Max 13.3 英寸 3.4K 屏支持全功能 Type-C 直连电脑副屏</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/ai/post/20260905/%E5%B0%8F%E7%B1%B3%E5%B9%B3%E6%9D%BF-9-Pro-Max-13.3-%E8%8B%B1%E5%AF%B8-3.4K-%E5%B1%8F%E6%94%AF%E6%8C%81%E5%85%A8%E5%8A%9F%E8%83%BD-Type-C-%E7%9B%B4%E8%BF%9E%E7%94%B5%E8%84%91%E5%89%AF%E5%B1%8F/</link>
      <pubDate>Sat, 05 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
